ily members, to be played back at memorials, second. Talking books for the blind he placed fourth. The teaching of elocution and foreign languages came in the middle of the list. The use that would define the device for the next century and a half, he listed almost as an afterthought. He spent the next decade trying to market the device as a business tool, was repeatedly outmaneuvered by competitors who marketed it for its more successful use. ID X (5 points) and Y (5 points).", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:51:53Z", "username": "Harshvardhan Ranade", "text": "Radio?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:51:59Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "not radio", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:52:20Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Phonograph?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:52:22Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Edison?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:52:22Z", "username": "Harshvardhan Ranade", "text": "Telephone", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-22T03:52:33Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Answers: X=Thomas Alva Edison, Y=phonograph", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]